---
description: Motion Lab project and source-editing rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` before editing. For motion work, read `skill/motion-design/SKILL.md` and its
relevant references. Treat `workspace/project.motion.json` as the active project, preserve stable
IDs, keep MotionDoc v2 valid, and run the documented checks. Never edit generated build output or
expose `.env.local`.
